abstract: >-
  An open-source workflow for constructing, simulating, and analyzing
  coarse-grained poly(dimethylsiloxane) elastomer networks with linear,
  ring, star, comb-like, and bottlebrush strand architectures.
keywords:
  - PDMS
  - polymer networks
  - molecular dynamics
  - coarse-grained simulation
  - network topology
